Focus kinetic energy and strike an enemy for [117%, 144%, 166%, 184%, 200% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as physical.

They will be pinned to the ground for [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns by the force of this attack.

Any frozen creature hit by this attack will take an extra [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; MP 100)] physical damage.

The extra damage will scale with your Mindpower.
